{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown hero from the Kholin species is pushed to escape the imminent fate of the universe.\u00a0The Oblivion Wave is destroying the whole space and time, and you need to find a way to stop it through your journey and save the universe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/539360ac2c42fd6f89666f5a3589dfb7.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet explodes while you wake up, and an old savior explains you about the Oblivion Wave, a power that erases everything in the universe. Find your way to escape the wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/68fa39fd26d5fe1dcf53f90ca4c45d19.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/5119604f4ffd75218127f9adb8c19802.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIFTOFF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift off with your spaceship to start your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/82f064fd66c9ad1e4d0324055a9e8c69.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAVEL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between randomly generated planets to continue your journey, gaining more time to escape the wave but losing resources on your spaceship, while deciding between time warp and biome water level difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/8530f778b3f4891b361ceee70fed2be3.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land to the new planet, performing a classic Moonlander-like game and trying not to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/d58cd4c9f86e76bc6b079f9475b9a4b1.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/3540867078700b197adbed8aa59266f4.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURAL PLANETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy procedurally generated planets with different terrains, water levels and vegetation. Once landed, feel free to explore and unveil the secrets of the new planet, but remember not to loose too much time as the wave is constantly chasing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/5df11571d6d39067fc84293b81a8acbc.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy resources to fill your spaceship fuel and travel to the next planet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/8f70401aaab627d196caccc4e230589a.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with multiple enemy species that want to stop you in your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/f8d89a73ea0f0086b3f96a74e497bcd8.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/5c57063ae4728af1264e12730a16006d.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find ancient astral disks protected by Kholin species, insert them into your spaceship to reveal new coordinates to follow, and discover and unlock new powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/6ffce78833a1e928db41cefb53f61a6d.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Kholin's ancient temple to choose from a set of temporal upgrades like <strong>kill heals</strong>, <strong>velocity increase,</strong>\u00a0<strong>resources break</strong>... and improve your abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/b19377225588746a6b88a7e07f5290a9.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RUNES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Runes temple to improve your arm weapon. Play and try to combine different runes like <strong>repeat</strong>, <strong>twin</strong> and <strong>spread</strong> that can be stacked together to form different types of weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/76bfac82ddef2d27012bbc2f9754aaa7.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BELT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly check your belt to check how much time left you have to escape the wave, while also checking your current upgrades and weapon setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/c69dbbd067fc3adf6e499c530d53eec2.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/f5b58a96ff352ff3ce91ef2f9f835618.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's how you learn and improve! Kholin ancient priests are protecting you, so every time you die, a Kholin Ancestor will bring you from death to give you another chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/c2fb2f851147b1fb1c38df43d64e3416.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME PLANET AND OLD SAVIOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like home at your home planet, where time stops and you can rest from your adventure. Let the Old Savior guide you through your trip, having talks and discovering new improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/cd2068e5748274f6f77c934cd7f81d1d.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIVERSAL MAP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the universal map and look at the stars to be able to send energy up in the sky, getting permanent upgrades for your next trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/1576c89aa00807674a98c62bf9fa63bf.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694550?t=1774346010","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694550?t=1774346010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/97a0a65aad368737bb6f11345a6e4f9a73c2fa43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774346010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/97a0a65aad368737bb6f11345a6e4f9a73c2fa43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774346010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4072750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown hero from the Kholin species is pushed to escape the imminent fate of the universe.\u00a0The Oblivion Wave is destroying the whole space and time, and you need to find a way to stop it through your journey and save the unive