_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/76bfac82ddef2d27012bbc2f9754aaa7.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BELT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly check your belt to check how much time left you have to escape the wave, while also checking your current upgrades and weapon setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/c69dbbd067fc3adf6e499c530d53eec2.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/f5b58a96ff352ff3ce91ef2f9f835618.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1000 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's how you learn and improve! Kholin ancient priests are protecting you, so every time you die, a Kholin Ancestor will bring you from death to give you another chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/c2fb2f851147b1fb1c38df43d64e3416.avif?t=1774346010\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOME PLANET AND OLD SAVIOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like home at your home planet, where time stops and you can rest from your adventure. Let the Old Savior guide you through your trip, having talks and discovering new improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/cd2068e5748274f6f77c934cd7f81d1d.avif